      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Calculate ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\operatorname{tan}⁡x.$",
      "worked_solution": "Let's recall the graph of $y=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14258704/assets/31b430f003171dcc04a8f17402d6035fbbc305c244d3676bbf5da83fa447bd50.png)\n\nAs $x$ increases, the values of $y$ range between $-\\infty $ and $\\infty $ periodically with period $\\pi .$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\operatorname{tan}⁡x=\\text{DNE.}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
